% Scenario: a documented key the writer does not honour. AutoRotatePages
% is accepted and recorded; the job runs to its page and the writer's
% report lists the key as not honoured.
<< /AutoRotatePages /All >> setdistillerparams
72 700 moveto 300 700 lineto stroke
showpage
